  "worked_solution": "To predict the time that must pass before the artwork is worth $$32\\,000,$ we need to substitute $y=32$ into the equation of the trend line and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =3x+5 \\\\ 32 & =3x+5 \\\\ 3x & =27 \\\\ x & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, according to this model, it takes approximately $9$ decades for the artwork to have a value of $$32\\,000.$ \n\nNote: The point where $y=32$ is not shown on our trend line. Therefore, our result *may* be unreliable.",
